{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "40270518",
      "title": "Analyzing Component Function Executions via React's DevTools Profiler",
      "sourceHash": "4c48d883b485b870087d5ea67466383641cc647612f2ff28fd615e3e0426dac9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 2.76,
          "en": "So understanding that React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.76,
          "end": 5.13,
          "en": "builds this tree of components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.13,
          "end": 9.18,
          "en": "and how it executes these different component functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.18,
          "end": 10.89,
          "en": "is crucial.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.89,
          "end": 14.91,
          "en": "And you can of course go through the code on your own",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.91,
          "end": 16.95,
          "en": "to understand how that looks like",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.95,
          "end": 19.86,
          "en": "and how these different components are related.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.86,
          "end": 23.91,
          "en": "You can also log stuff to the console, as I'm doing it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.91,
          "end": 27.96,
          "en": "but you can also use the React Developer Tools.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.96,
          "end": 31.8,
          "en": "I did show you these tools earlier in the course already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.8,
          "end": 33.87,
          "en": "in the debugging section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.87,
          "end": 37.29,
          "en": "The React Developer Tools are simply an extension",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.29,
          "end": 40.29,
          "en": "which you can, for example, install in Chrome.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.29,
          "end": 41.82,
          "en": "And if you've got them installed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.82,
          "end": 44.76,
          "en": "you can open up your developer tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.76,
          "end": 48.21,
          "en": "and there if it's not an incognito tab,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.21,
          "end": 51.213,
          "en": "you should find this profiler tab.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.17,
          "end": 55.175,
          "en": "And this profiler tab can also be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.175,
          "end": 59.52,
          "en": "to understand which components are updating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.52,
          "end": 61.05,
          "en": "and are being re-rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.05,
          "end": 64.59,
          "en": "You could say, under which circumstances.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.59,
          "end": 67.8,
          "en": "For this you can start profiling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.8,
          "end": 70.44,
          "en": "by clicking this button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.44,
          "end": 72.6,
          "en": "and then you can interact with the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.6,
          "end": 75.51,
          "en": "and for example, increment the counter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.51,
          "end": 77.97,
          "en": "And if you then stop profiling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.97,
          "end": 80.868,
          "en": "you will see a graphical representation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.868,
          "end": 85.743,
          "en": "of which component functions were executed for which reason.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.78999999999999,
          "end": 89.76,
          "en": "And you can switch between different representations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.76,
          "end": 91.38,
          "en": "depending on what you prefer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.38,
          "end": 94.32,
          "en": "So let me walk you through what this means.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.32,
          "end": 98.64,
          "en": "If you're in this flame graph chart mode here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.64,
          "end": 100.56,
          "en": "you in the end get a representation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.56,
          "end": 103.2,
          "en": "that also shows you the order",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.2,
          "end": 106.86,
          "en": "in which component functions were executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.86,
          "end": 110.45,
          "en": "And you also get a relation between component functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 110.45,
          "end": 113.4,
          "en": "For example, here you see that the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.4,
          "end": 116.25,
          "en": "is the root component, since it's at the top,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.25,
          "end": 118.44,
          "en": "and that it has this header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.44,
          "end": 121.293,
          "en": "and the counter components as children.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.937,
          "end": 127.02,
          "en": "Now you also see if you hover over 'App', or 'Header',",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.02,
          "end": 131.16,
          "en": "that for one, they are highlighted on the left,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.16,
          "end": 134.22,
          "en": "but that they also did not render.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.22,
          "end": 136.98,
          "en": "So that clicking this increment button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.98,
          "end": 140.82,
          "en": "did not cause the app or header component functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.82,
          "end": 143.73,
          "en": "to be executed again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.73,
          "end": 145.23,
          "en": "And that makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.23,
          "end": 148.26,
          "en": "because if you take a look at the application code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.26,
          "end": 153.26,
          "en": "you see that the app component is not rendering any state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.48,
          "end": 157.38,
          "en": "that would be changed by incrementing the counter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.38,
          "end": 161.52,
          "en": "It does manage some states that can be changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.52,
          "end": 164.25,
          "en": "through this input here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.25,
          "end": 167.1,
          "en": "but that's not what we changed here in this example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.1,
          "end": 169.95,
          "en": "Instead, I clicked this button below,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.95,
          "end": 173.16,
          "en": "therefore the change that occurred happened",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.16,
          "end": 174.81,
          "en": "in the counter component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.81,
          "end": 178.71,
          "en": "because it's in there where I clicked this increment button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.71,
          "end": 182.554,
          "en": "which led to this counter state being changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.554,
          "end": 185.4,
          "en": "Therefore, it was the counter component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 185.4,
          "end": 187.35,
          "en": "that was re-executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.35,
          "end": 190.561,
          "en": "But as you also learned earlier in the course already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.561,
          "end": 195.561,
          "en": "such component reevaluations then don't propagate up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.65,
          "end": 200.52,
          "en": "So React executing this counter component function again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 200.52,
          "end": 204.453,
          "en": "has no impact on the parent component, the app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 205.29,
          "end": 208.65,
          "en": "It does have an impact on the child components though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 208.65,
          "end": 210.48,
          "en": "because as I explained before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 210.48,
          "end": 213.32999999999998,
          "en": "of course all these custom component functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.32999999999998,
          "end": 215.22,
          "en": "are executed again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 215.22,
          "end": 218.94,
          "en": "and they do receive those prop values again, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.94,
          "end": 222.42000000000002,
          "en": "And you also see this here, in this flame graph chart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 222.42000000000002,
          "end": 224.19,
          "en": "because here you can see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.19,
          "end": 228.78,
          "en": "that we got four components that were executed again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.78,
          "end": 231.66,
          "en": "Basically all components that are colored here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 231.66,
          "end": 233.82,
          "en": "were executed again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 233.82,
          "end": 236.028,
          "en": "So in this case, the icon button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.028,
          "end": 239.85,
          "en": "and the icon that's displayed by this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 239.85,
          "end": 243.24,
          "en": "this icon button and the counter output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 243.24,
          "end": 246.81,
          "en": "And actually it's not just the minus icon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 246.81,
          "end": 250.17,
          "en": "that was executed again, but also the plus icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 250.17,
          "end": 252.24,
          "en": "And we can actually see that here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 252.24,
          "end": 254.91,
          "en": "if we switch to the ranked chart mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 254.91,
          "end": 259.91,
          "en": "where we only see the components that were re-rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 260.37,
          "end": 263.19,
          "en": "And where we then see the component that in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 263.19,
          "end": 265.44,
          "en": "cost the re-render cycle,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 265.44,
          "end": 267.27,
          "en": "the counter component in this case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 267.27,
          "end": 269.28,
          "en": "because it's state changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 269.28,
          "end": 271.92,
          "en": "and then other nested components below it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 271.92,
          "end": 276.03,
          "en": "like the minus icon, the counter output, the icon button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 276.03,
          "end": 279.33299999999997,
          "en": "the other icon button and the plus icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 280.17,
          "end": 281.55,
          "en": "So we see that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 281.55,
          "end": 283.14,
          "en": "But of course the idea is the same,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 283.14,
          "end": 286.89,
          "en": "that we can see which components were executed again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 286.89,
          "end": 288.543,
          "en": "and how they're related.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 289.47,
          "end": 292.35,
          "en": "You can also go to the settings here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 292.35,
          "end": 295.14,
          "en": "and under profiler, enable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 295.14,
          "end": 297.747,
          "en": "'Record why each component rendered'.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 298.89,
          "end": 303.33,
          "en": "And if you do enable this and you then clear this output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 303.33,
          "end": 305.88,
          "en": "and you start another recording session,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 305.88,
          "end": 308.82,
          "en": "which sometimes doesn't work, so I'll just reload here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 308.82,
          "end": 312.003,
          "en": "and you then increment again and stop this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 313.11,
          "end": 315.78,
          "en": "You'll now of course see the same result as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 315.78,
          "end": 316.613,
          "en": "basically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 316.613,
          "end": 319.05,
          "en": "But now if you hover over a component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 319.05,
          "end": 322.53,
          "en": "you also see why this did change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 322.53,
          "end": 323.91,
          "en": "And if you click on it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 323.91,
          "end": 327.09,
          "en": "you can also see some details here to the right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 327.09,
          "end": 330.92,
          "en": "You see that this rendered again because one hook changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 330.92,
          "end": 332.82,
          "en": "In this case, this simply means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 332.82,
          "end": 334.653,
          "en": "that the underlying state changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 335.67,
          "end": 338.97,
          "en": "So these dev tools can be another nice tool",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 338.97,
          "end": 342.33,
          "en": "to understand how components are executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 342.33,
          "end": 345.09000000000003,
          "en": "and why they were executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 345.09000000000003,
          "end": 347.37,
          "en": "And it is really crucial to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 347.37,
          "end": 350.929,
          "en": "this fundamental concept because this also allows you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 350.929,
          "end": 355.233,
          "en": "to optimize your application in various aspects.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}